    {$kieran}: She made a mess of the place before she left. What did she grab?
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You do not touch the clutter, instead scanning for anything that could tell you why things are so disorganized. What you think is a computerrests on its side.][/nomarkup] #lastline 
    <<if Roll ("Intelligence","Technology")>=4>>
        {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Upon closer inspection you recognize the model. It's sad that such a technological marvel seems to be so haphazardly disrespected, especially since it's a relatively new model, only made available to consumers a year or two ago.][/nomarkup] #line:04edffd
